      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, what do u mean by \"goblin's gambit\"? i'm just trying to understand the math. can u just explain the actual formula for the monthly interest and how much of my payment goes to principal vs interest? i need the actual numbers/logic, not metaphors.",
      "source": "evaluator"
